        </a>
        <a href="/deals" class="px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Exclusive Perks & Deals</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono bg-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">Active</span>
        </a>
